  "sourceBoundContracts": [
    "SwAttrSetChg retains borrowed original set/delta references; copy clones only the delta. AttrSetChangeHint has exact old/new descriptors. ClientNotifyAttrChg locks original SwModify while dispatching, suppresses reentrance and unlocks in finally.",
    "SwFormat mutators collect actual effective old/new values through native BC methods. Registered parent SwFormat clients clone and Differentiate inherited deltas by all local WhichIds including INVALID/DISABLED. Row/cell generic attribute overrides removed. Locked native claim copies do not broadcast. Full native cache/font/fill/frame invalidation/geometry remains partial.",
    "Existing browser paint-device invalidation follows actual native clients without recording an extra document model mutation. Exact original row/cell registered frames, Undo/Redo graphs and mounted main UI retained. Device boundary remains a bounded browser adaptation; full direct native UI registration and native VCL behavior unverified.",
    "Native defaults127/157/158/159 use SvxProtectItem flags false, SfxUInt32Item/CntUInt32Item hierarchy, SwTableBoxNumFormat100 with locale text normalization modulo10000, SwTableBoxFormula non-sharing/detached clone ownership and SwTableBoxValue zero/NaN equality. Full SwTableFormula second-base/parser/calculation/name conversion/presentation/UNO remains unported.",
    "All660 prior acceptance files remain byte-identical. Existing317 metadata records fields/status/default/classification/order/prefixes retained; one new cellatr module unverified, total318. Registered IO/recovery/settings deviations, whole writer-view, pin and stash preserved; goal ACTIVE."
  ]
}
